      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Puente%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "La Puente’s streets were once lined with 1950s‑era strip malls, a relic of mid‑century commercial architecture still visible today.",
